{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"main_base_l9","model_identifier":"main_base_l9","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# main_base_l9\n\nMain base level 9, Marble Castle: the castle refaced in white marble with coloured (blue glazed) roof tiles and team-colour banners on every tower.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 14 columns (224 x 224 units, 6.30 x 6.30 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -119..119, y 0..396, z -119..119 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 381, construction_0 53, construction_33 188, construction_66 242, ruined 241 (10 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- keep: 100 x 366 x 100 centred at x 0, z 8\n- curtain wall: 224 x 112 x 224 ring\n- corner towers: 40 x 192 x 40\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `main_base_l9_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `main_base_l9_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_main_base_l9` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2.0 | loop | team flag on the keep turret flutters. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -49)\n- `slot_parapet_1` at (-20, 283, -32)\n- `slot_parapet_2` at (20, 283, -32)\n- `slot_parapet_3` at (40, 283, -12)\n- `slot_parapet_4` at (40, 283, 28)\n- `slot_parapet_5` at (20, 283, 48)\n- `slot_parapet_6` at (-20, 283, 48)\n- `slot_parapet_7` at (-40, 283, 28)\n- `slot_parapet_8` at (-40, 283, -12)\n- `slot_tower_1` at (-96, 153, -96)\n- `slot_tower_2` at (96, 153, -96)\n- `slot_tower_3` at (-96, 153, 96)\n- `slot_tower_4` at (96, 153, 96)\n- `slot_gate` at (0, 0, -122)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":1024},"elements":[{"name":"keep_base","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-50.0,0.0,-42.0],"to":[50.0,6.0,58.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[247.0,790.0,347.0,796.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[347.0,790.0,447.0,796.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[247.0,790.0,347.0,796.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[347.0,790.0,447.0,796.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[96.0,436.0,196.0,536.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[96.0,436.0,196.0,536.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4fd5dc52-4c7b-5ca7-a528-03c3afcf35b2"},{"name":"keep_body","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48.0,6.0,-40.0],"to":[48.0,280.0,56.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[104.0,0.0,200.0,274.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[200.0,0.0,296.0,274.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[104.0,0.0,200.0,274.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[200.0,0.0,296.0,274.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[296.0,436.0,392.0,532.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[296.0,436.0,392.0,532.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"7fa03a6b-98ca-5be8-a6aa-dacdd62c02aa"},{"name":"keep_s